 ┃                                                                            ┃
 ┃ Handy query for finding stale sessions:                                    ┃
 ┃                                                                            ┃
 ┃ ```sql                                                                     ┃
 ┃ SELECT id, user_id, last_seen                                              ┃
 ┃ FROM sessions                                                              ┃
 ┃ WHERE last_seen < now() - interval '30 days'                               ┃
 ┃ ORDER BY last_seen;                                                        ┃
 ┃ ```                                                                        ┃
 ┃                                                                            ┃
 ┃ Could become a cleanup job.                                                ┃
